source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: A greater-than sign ends the autolinked URL in Jira.
-- input.jira --
{{http://example.com>a}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt><a href="http://example.com" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">http://example.com</a>&gt;a</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`http://example.com>a`
-- warnings.json --
[]
